## Attribution

When using the datasets, please cite the associated research paper:

**Title:** Physics-Guided Structured Representation Learning for Doppler Wind Lidar Velocity Forecasting

**Authors:** See the repository's CITATION.cff file.

**Repository:** https://github.com/mingxushi/pgsrl-dwl

If the associated paper has not yet been formally published, please cite the repository and update the citation information when the paper becomes available.

## Scope

This license applies to all raw and processed datasets distributed in the `data/` directory, including the associated metadata and data manifests.

The software source code is licensed separately under the MIT License specified in the repository's root `LICENSE` file.

